cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CerebroCAM: Brain tumor MRI classification with duplicate-aware evaluation and Grad-CAM"
abstract: >-
  A compact CNN classifies brain MRI slices into glioma, meningioma, pituitary tumor and no tumor.
  The project audits the public datasets for duplicate images with perceptual hashing, evaluates the
  model on deduplicated internal and external test sets, tests data augmentation over three seeds and
  explains predictions with Grad-CAM.
